{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "x-asserted-against-backend": false,
  "info": {
    "title": "Traigent Backend Crew Routes",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Crew catalog routes (slice 1). Declared ahead of the backend implementation (CREW-11); x-asserted-against-backend is false until the BE routes land. Tenant comes from the canonical auth context; project_id is the project path scope checked against it, never a header. Feature gate: crews; feature off answers the same closed 404 as a missing crew (outermost check). Slice 1 serves human principals only; API-key callers get the same closed 404. No PUT/DELETE on bindings: membership changes append a revision. The crew_run, crew_member_execution and crew_handoff schemas are slice-3 contracts with no routes yet."
  },
